(12385, 74, 74, 68, 7, 'Not Interested', 'Muhammad Bilal', '03073330631', NULL, NULL, 167, NULL, 'Faisalabad', 'jinnah', 'Male', 'Other', '100', 'Provide him the details of IELTS. I told him fee criteria that he can pay fee in installments but he asked for concession so provide him 10% discount but then told me that He is a relative of Sir basharat so is there more concession him fee then I told him that i will discuss with my Sir basharat and Sir adeel. I discuss his case will sir basharat he said give him concession also sir adeel said so i told him 255 discount last but he was asking for more discount even after 25% discount and said i will talk to sir basharat and continuously he is not not responding to calls and messages and keep saying i will visit. Discuss his case with sir sheraz he said final we can provide him 30%. I again tried to call him but he is not answering drop a voice message on whatsapp again he said due to busy schedule he did not visit will visit in 1 or 2 days', '2025-04-14 09:53:00', '2025-03-15 07:37:49', '2025-04-13 08:05:25', 'Walkin', 'incampus'),
