(12387, 74, 87, 65, 7, 'Not Interested', 'Shahid Sharif', '03126156803', NULL, NULL, 167, NULL, 'Faisalabad', 'jinnah', 'Male', 'Other', '100', 'He came and wanted information about which courses we are offering told him the overall details of the courses their durations, fee and worth of our institute and certificates. He said I will told you the course after selecting. after that he is not responding to calls and messages and on Thursday he said i only wanted to do NEBOSH course but you have no batch available . Call him today he is not answering the call drop a voice message on whatsapp', '2025-04-29 09:53:00', '2025-03-15 07:48:09', '2025-04-29 05:57:48', 'Walkin', 'incampus'),
(12388, 84, 26, 47, 7, 'Not Interested', 'Fadi Shk', '03205265692', NULL, 'Fahadshk2122@gmail.com', 167, NULL, 'Faisalabad', 'milad road', 'Male', 'Facebook', '100', 'He said that he is currently in Lahore, so if he returns to Faisalabad by Sunday, he will visit our Jinnah Colony branch.', '2025-04-28 10:03:00', '2025-03-15 07:51:33', '2025-04-28 09:00:29', 'facebook', 'incampus'),
(12389, 74, 53, 74, 7, 'Not Interested', 'Moeez', '03049250511', NULL, NULL, 167, NULL, 'Faisalabad', 'jinnah', 'Male', 'Other', '100', 'He visited the branch and wanted to do c++ course. Provide him the details. Fee was not confimed so I told him I will tell you later after that I called him and told the fee he said I will come tomorrow. then her sister told  that we took admission in free courses at UAF so I tried  to contact him to convince him somehow next day i called him but number was blocked then i call him without dialing 88 he said he will visit and secure his admission. I called him today but he is not answering the call. Drop a message on whatsapp', '2025-04-23 10:07:00', '2025-03-15 07:58:02', '2025-04-23 10:08:45', 'Walkin', 'incampus'),
